  "body": "Tender: Closes on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 4:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nAn exceptional development opportunity in the sought after Gulf Harbour precinct, comprising the second stage of the beautifully landscaped Santa Rosa Apartments.\r\n\r\nThe established resort style environment already features a tennis court, swimming pool, BBQ area and landscaped common facilities, providing an attractive setting for the proposed apartment development.\r\n\r\n• Approximately 6,600m² of land held under Unit Title\r\n\r\n• 360-degree panoramic views across the Hauraki Gulf and beyond\r\n\r\n• Adjoining the former Gulf Harbour Country Club, once ranked among New Zealand's Top 10 golf courses\r\n\r\n• Two Stratum in Freehold titles comprising 43 Future Development Units (FDUs) and 91 Auxiliary Units (AUs) for car parks and associated areas\r\n\r\n• Resource consent for 43 apartments across two buildings — Marbella and San Sebastian\r\n\r\n• Most civil infrastructure connections are already in place, offering substantial potential cost savings\r\n\r\n• Development contributions were paid upon completion of Stage One and Stage Two\r\n\r\n• Comprehensive Information Package available upon request\r\n\r\nLifestyle & Location\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal lifestyle locations, Gulf Harbour offers an enviable combination of waterfront living, recreation and accessibility.\r\n\r\nGulf Harbour Marina Village is just a short stroll away, with waterfront cafés, restaurants and bars. The nearby Shakespeare Regional Park provides extensive walking trails and three safe swimming beaches, creating an outstanding recreational environment.\r\n\r\nFor convenient commuting, the Gulf Harbour Ferry provides a scenic, traffic-free connection to Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nQuality education is also close at hand, including local primary schooling and the highly regarded Wentworth Private College.\r\n\r\nAn Opportunity with Scale\r\n\r\nWith significant infrastructure already established, panoramic water views, consent for 43 apartments 91 carparks, and an exceptional resort-style setting, this is a rare opportunity to secure a substantial development site in Gulf Harbour.\r\n\r\nInformation Package Available — Enquire Now.",
